TITLE:: MediatorGui
Create a window for viewing the contents of a Mediators environment.

See also: Mediator class.
DESCRIPTION:: 
This class does not have any subclasses. It a draft for developing a more functional Gui for Mediators.
CLASSMETHODS:: 
Create a MediatorGui window for the mediator named by the argument. If such a window already exists, bring it to the front. The argument TELETYPE::mediator:: must be a symbol.
INSTANCEMETHODS:: 
Internal method. Add self as mediator to dependent.  Enable updates when the mediator changes.
This method is called when the mediator changes. It calls TELETYPE::\changed:: on the MediatorGui.  In response to this, the GUI window, if it is open, updates its contents.
